# DP100 fw 1.5 / hw 1.4, USB serial 3F0F22964000, Vin 15.22 V. Nothing connected to the output.
# Initial state: output ON (state=1), 5.000 V / 0.500 A, OVP 30.5 V, OCP 5.05 A, preset 0.

## 1. Single 0x20 write with state=0 and unchanged V/I (dp100ctl off, pre-fix code)
TX FB 35 02 01 80 6F E8
RX FA 35 02 0A 00 01 88 13 F4 01 24 77 BA 13 42 75          active set: state=1 5000/500/30500/5050
TX FB 35 03 0A 20 00 88 13 F4 01 24 77 BA 13 B3 8D          0x20, state=0, same setpoints
RX FA 35 03 01 01 C3 88                                     ACK
TX FB 35 04 01 80 8F E9
RX FA 35 04 0A 00 00 88 13 F4 01 24 77 BA 13 47 ED          read-back: state=0
# Telemetry 0 .. 5.5 s after the write (50 Hz then 2 Hz):
#   Vout 4.997 .. 5.000 V, Iout 0 .. 1 mA, out_mode=1 (CV), work_st=0   -> output still ON

## 2. ElluIFX/DLL CloseOut double write (raw script)
start                        Vout= 4996 mV Iout=   0 mA out_mode=1 work_st=0 | set: state=0 V=5000 I=500 OVP=30500 OCP=5050
TX FB 35 67 0A 20 00 00 00 00 00 24 77 BA 13 C1 71  -> ack 01  (CloseOut V=0 I=0)
+40 ms                       Vout= 3155 mV Iout=   0 mA out_mode=2 work_st=0 | set: state=0 V=0 I=0 OVP=30500 OCP=5050
TX FB 35 6A 0A 20 00 88 13 F4 01 24 77 BA 13 2F 11  -> ack 01  (CloseOut real setpoints)
+50 ms after 2nd write       Vout=  503 mV Iout=   0 mA out_mode=2 work_st=0 | set: state=0 V=5000 I=500 OVP=30500 OCP=5050
+200 ms after 2nd write      Vout=    0 mV Iout=   0 mA out_mode=2 work_st=0 | set: state=0 V=5000 I=500 OVP=30500 OCP=5050
+2000 ms after 2nd write     Vout=    0 mV Iout=   0 mA out_mode=2 work_st=0 | set: state=0 V=5000 I=500 OVP=30500 OCP=5050

## 3. Setpoint change with output OFF (dp100ctl set -v 3.3, then set -v 5.0)
TX FB 35 02 01 80 6F E8
RX FA 35 02 0A 00 00 88 13 F4 01 24 77 BA 13 4F E5
TX FB 35 04 0A 20 00 E4 0C F4 01 24 77 BA 13 AE FA          0x20, state=0, 3300 mV / 500 mA
RX FA 35 04 01 01 72 49                                     ACK
TX FB 35 05 01 80 DE 29
RX FA 35 05 0A 00 00 E4 0C F4 01 24 77 BA 13 52 92          read-back 3300 mV, state=0
# Telemetry 1.5 s: Vout 0.000 V, out_mode=2 (OFF)
# Preset P0 read (index 0x00) still 5000 mV / 500 mA, stored state=1 -> 0x20 does not modify stored presets
# set -v 5.0: ACK, read-back 5000 mV state=0, Vout 0, out_mode=2
## 4. HIL test hil_setpoint_write_with_output_off (new code): pass. Final: OFF, 5.000 V / 0.500 A, OVP 30.5 V, OCP 5.05 A.
